      "created_at": "2015-08-05T11:06:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Huh.</p><p><span>That Red Band trailer was worse that the Green Band(?) trailer, it's like they went \"Let's add in swears because we can\" (and they still censored the song despite having Deadpool utter the exact same words 10 seconds later!).</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Overall I'm still looking forward to the film, but that trailer did not make me more (or less) excited to see it.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>And I had no idea Blind Al and Weasel were in the film, so huzzah for that.</span></p>",
