      "raw": "<p>Huh.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">That Red Band trailer was worse that the Green Band(?) trailer, it&#39;s like they went &quot;Let&#39;s add in swears because we can&quot; (and they still censored the song despite having Deadpool utter the exact same words 10 seconds later!).</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Overall I&#39;m still looking forward to the film, but that trailer did not make me more (or less) excited to see it.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">And I had no idea Blind Al and Weasel were in the film, so huzzah for that.</span></p>",
